    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbopesi sya acimlongola",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku liŵamalisisye Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kutaŵa citenti cakusimanilana ni AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵajimisile mawuta ni kujiŵika pajika pamo ni yida yakwe yosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ayimwene ŵa maŵele ŵiŵaliji ŵakulongolela ngosyo sya ja Aisalaeli, ŵakulolela pakwaŵalanga ŵandu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵayice nayo yakupeleka yawo ya mbopesi kwa AMBUJE: mageleta msano ni limo ni ng'ombe syecele 12, ligeleta limo lya ŵakulongolela ŵaŵili ni ng'ombe jecele jimo ja jwakulongolela jwalijose. Panyuma pakuyipeleka yeleyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatite kwa Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mpocele jele mitukaji kuti jiŵe jakupanganyicisya masengo gatigatendekwe ga citenti, ajipelece mitukajo kwa Alefi malinga ni masengo gitagatende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mose ŵapelece yigeletayo ni ng'ombe syecelesyo kwa Alefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵapelece yigeleta yiŵili ni ng'ombe syecele mcece ku liŵasa lya Geleshoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni yigeleta mcece ni ng'ombe syecele msano ni sitatu ku liŵasa lya Melali. Masengo gawo gosope gene galiji gakuti agatendeje pakulongoleledwa ni Itamala mwanace jwa Aloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mose nginapeleka kose yigeleta kapena ng'ombe syecele ku liŵasa lya Kohati, ligongo yindu yakusagulidwa yiŵayisamalilaga yaliji yakuti ayinyakuleje pa makoyo gawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
